---
import Section from "../../ui/Section.astro";
import Container from "../../ui/Container.astro";
import Button from "../../ui/Button.astro";
---

<Section id="big-cta" class="bg-accent" border="top-bottom" py="py-0">
  <Container px="px-0">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-text-inverse px-8 sm:px-0 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-center">
      <div class="flex w-fit flex-col justify-start self-center py-8 md:py-16 2xl:py-24 lg:self-auto">
        <div class="max-w-120 text-left text-balance">
          <h2 class="text-heading">Остались вопросы? Мы готовы ответить.</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 md:mt-3 xl:mt-4 text-body-lg text-text-inverse/90">
            Оставьте контакты – разберёмся в ситуации и предложим понятный план действий.
          </p>
        </div>

        <form class="mt-8 grid w-full max-w-90 gap-4 md:mt-10" method="post">
          <div class="grid gap-4 max-w-90">
            <div>
              <label class="sr-only" for="big-cta-name">Ваше имя</label>
              <input
                class="h-9 w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-card px-3 text-ui-sm text-text-primary outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-text-secondary focus:border-text-inverse focus:ring-1 focus:ring-text-inverse"
                id="big-cta-name"
                name="name"
                type="text"
                autocomplete="name"
                placeholder="Ваше имя"
                required
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="sr-only" for="big-cta-phone">Номер телефона</label>
              <input
                class="h-9 w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-card px-3 text-ui-sm text-text-primary outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-text-secondary focus:border-text-inverse focus:ring-1 focus:ring-text-inverse"
                id="big-cta-phone"
                name="phone"
                type="tel"
                inputmode="tel"
                autocomplete="tel"
                placeholder="Ваш телефон"
                required
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">


            <Button type="submit" size="sm" variant="secondary" class="w-fit">
              Получить консультацию
            </Button>

            <label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-caption text-text-inverse/85">
              <input
                class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 accent-accent"
                name="consent"
                type="checkbox"
                required
              />
              <span class="text-caption">Соглашаюсь с политикой конфиденциальности</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <img
        src="/images/help.svg"
        alt=""
        class="h-auto w-full max-w-100 self-center lg:self-auto"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
